  "url": "https://cornhuskerswire.usatoday.com/story/sports/college/cornhuskers/mens-basketball/2026/03/26/nebraska-basketball-iowa-hawkeyes-ben-mcccollum-sweet-16-ncaa-tournament-press-conference/89325617007/",
